H9 metamod.dll -- Metamod-R built from source
==============================================

What this is
------------

addons\metamod\dlls\metamod.dll is Metamod-R built by H9 from TSM\metamod-r: upstream
rehlds/metamod-r at commit 56590c5c70fa95775051888b7fe0a4e285856ebb (2026-09-17), with H9's
patches in that folder (metamod-r\H9-SOURCE.txt):

  h9-slots128.patch   the client-cvar query table (MPlayerList::m_players) holds 128 player
                      slots, and every look-up is bounded by it as well as by maxClients.
                      Upstream sizes it from the HLSDK's MAX_CLIENTS (32) and bounds the
                      look-ups by maxClients only, so on a server past 32 slots a query from
                      slot 33 and up was written past the table.

