Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The goldsrc-net prebuilt, Metamod-r 1.3.0.196 (goldsrc-net/Metamod-R b2ea6fb), SHA256
0A6B311F48F8708EF4FFF05CD31833E4B766AFC6DD705A11B6354D77FFF756B6, kept as metamod.dll.bak_slots beside this file.
goldsrc-net forked rehlds at 4db16ff (2025-07-22); rehlds has had only Linux CI and packaging
commits since. The fork adds a hook JIT rewritten on AsmJit with x64 and aarch64 support,
plugin file name suffixes for 64-bit builds, Linux library floors, and fixes to its own JIT
rewrite. This build runs rehlds' x86 JIT (jitasm), which picks a hooked call's return value
before restoring the meta globals and formats variadic calls itself. Same exports, same
interface version, same game support list, same plugins.ini: for H9's 32-bit Windows server
nothing it relies on differs.

